 Cwater) = log(C1-oct / (Ctotal - C1-oct)) = log(A1-oct / (Atotal - A1-oct)) where A1-oct corresponds to the absorbance of WSO phase and Atotal the actual concentration of the WSO before shaking."}],"ccdc":["NAJCOV"]}